Derivation from eMule
---------------------
njMule is an independent re-implementation in Java of the eMule file-sharing
client. Protocol constants, file formats and algorithms were translated from
the eMule source code, the lower-case table Kad applies to keywords is taken
from eMule's resource files, and the user-interface strings and their
translations are converted from eMule's resource files.

